<title>UK: Prudential seen opening higher on M&amp;G sale.</title>
<headline>Prudential seen opening higher on M&amp;G sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Prudential Corp were seen opening around 10p higher on Tuesday after the company said it had agreed to sell its M&amp;G Reinsurance unit for 1.75 billion stg, traders said.</p>
<p>On Friday the shares closed at 437p.</p>
</text>
